<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>PXKK - Login</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+Black&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');
        :root {
            --purple: #8A4FFF; --purple-hi: #A370FF; --black: #040404;
            --white: #FFF; --gray-hi: #B8B8C2; --gray-mid: #7A7A88; --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
        body {
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 15% 10%, rgba(138,79,255,0.15) 0%, transparent 50%), radial-gradient(circle at 85% 90%, rgba(138,79,255,0.08) 0%, transparent 50%), var(--black);
            color: var(--white); min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow-x: hidden;
        }
        .login-container { display: flex; width: 100%; max-width: 1000px; padding: 20px; gap: 40px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .hero { flex: 1; min-width: 300px; }
        .hero h1 { font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 64px); line-height: 1; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .hero h1 span { color: var(--purple); }
        .hero p { color: var(--gray-hi); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .login-card { background: rgba(10,10,10,0.6); border: 1px solid var(--border); backdrop-filter: blur(24px); padding: 40px; border-radius: 32px; width: 100%; max-width: 400px; text-align: center; }
        .login-card h2 { font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .login-card p { color: var(--gray-hi); margin-bottom: 30px; font-size: 14px; }
        .btn-discord { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; width: 100%; padding: 16px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--purple), #6B2EE0); color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 99px; font-weight: 700; transition: 0.2s; }
        .btn-discord:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(138,79,255,0.4); }
        @media (max-width: 768px) { .login-container { flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; text-align: center; } .hero { display: none; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="login-container">
        <div class="hero">
            <h1>Gerencie seu<br>servidor com<br><span>precisão total.</span></h1>
            <p>Toda a configuração do seu bot em um painel único, seguro e intuitivo.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="login-card">
            <h2>Bem-vindo</h2>
            <p>Autentique-se com sua conta do Discord para acessar o painel.</p>
            <a href="/auth" class="btn-discord">
                <svg width="24" height="24" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.3 4.4A19.7 19.7 0 0 0 15.4 3l-.3.5a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 4.3 2.2 15 15 0 0 0-12.8 0A14.6 14.6 0 0 1 10.9 3.5L10.6 3a19.7 19.7 0 0 0-4.9 1.4C2.6 8.6 1.9 12.7 2.3 16.7a19.8 19.8 0 0 0 6 3l.8-1.3a13 13 0 0 1-2-1l.5-.4a14 14 0 0 0 12.8 0l.5.4a13 13 0 0 1-2 1l.8 1.3a19.8 19.8 0 0 0 6-3c.5-4.6-.7-8.6-3.4-12.3ZM9 14.6c-1.2 0-2.2-1.1-2.2-2.4S7.8 9.8 9 9.8s2.2 1.1 2.2 2.4S10.2 14.6 9 14.6Zm6 0c-1.2 0-2.2-1.1-2.2-2.4s1-2.4 2.2-2.4 2.2 1.1 2.2 2.4-1 2.4-2.2 2.4Z"/></svg>
                Entrar com Discord
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>